Package: MacrophageFramework
Type: Package
Title: Multidimensional Macrophage Profiling
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R:
    person(
        "Alessandro", "Palma",
        email = "alessandro.palma2@uniroma1.it",
        role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")
    )
Description:
    Provides a multidimensional computational framework for macrophage
    profiling based on an ontology of biological programs. The framework
    independently detects macrophage populations and characterizes their
    lineage-associated and functional-state programs using program-level
    expression scores, detection coverage, gene-program coherence, cluster
    profiles, and profile similarity. The framework is designed to capture
    continuous and combinatorial macrophage states without imposing
    binary activation categories.
